vivo:ClinicalOrganization iao:0000112 """In the future we may be able to make this a defined class that would not need to be directly asserted, but the consensus seems to be that some organizations \"are\" clinical and some \"are\" research organizations and that the distinction is important enough to warrant the additional class and class assertions""";
                          iao:0000115 "Any organization with a significant clinical function as a matter of course and not just through occasional clinical roles",
