vivo:PrivateCompany iao:0000112 "Definition obtained here: http://answers.ask.com/Business/Finance/what_is_a_private_company.  Examples of private companies found here: http://www.forbes.com/2008/11/03/largest-private-companies-biz-privates08-cx_sr_1103private_land.html",
